<p>Heavy rains over 48 hours killed at least six people and displaced thousands in Brazil’s northeastern states of Pernambuco and Paraiba, Brazil’s federal government said Saturday. The rains triggered flooding and landslides in Recife, the capital of Pernambuco, and nearby areas, with deaths reported in Recife, Olinda and Paraiba. Federal and state authorities reported displaced and homeless residents as municipalities continued response operations.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/TzkKHrkto6EdiCcUBo6x-eLuJ_vRflhhKBOr7abfvX2COkIfNGb1rsjiB8XglfOOQUPyYjHpPgTto0_NAvDWQe6vxF2AwcwH8r8IegRxhvfmkMtVmCf2cwyp_aAwgs7-bVgqar0TVRkF2U5q8qA-KufEdWU8eA2yViydE84-3NzvlESYZhJH5o-GkYYHG0Se69qIi0dIVMecn2srVUQfPxheco3OVXvgFFLCI8Ion_2dPE71kqbdLRCQHI1miSQ4qVIBOTN8h-I' alt='Emergency response in areas affected by heavy rains in Pernambuco' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Family deaths: In Recife’s Dois Unidos neighborhood, an 18-month-old girl died after a landslide, becoming the third member of the same family killed in the collapse, Jornal de Brasilia reported.</li><li>Latest confirmed Pernambuco fatality: Cooperativa said a 34-year-old man reported missing Friday night was found in Recife’s Capiberibe neighborhood.</li><li>Local spread in Pernambuco: Cooperativa said residents forced from their homes were in 11 municipalities, mostly in the Recife metropolitan region and nearby rural areas.</li><li>Family survivor: Jornal de Brasilia reported that the father in the Dois Unidos landslide survived and was taken for medical care, with no update on his condition in the provided report.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Brazilian Integration and Regional Development Ministry: The ministry said the National Center for Risk and Disaster Management issued 22 alerts during the critical rainfall period and raised the operational level to maximum alert because of the impacts in Pernambuco and Paraiba and the forecast for the region. (<a href='https://tribune.com.pk/story/2606098/six-dead-as-heavy-rains-hit-brazil'>Tribune</a>)</li><li>Pernambuco civil defense: A civil defense bulletin said the deaths in Recife and Olinda included three young children and that four other people were injured in Pernambuco. (<a href='https://www.cooperativa.cl/noticias/mundo/brasil/fuertes-temporales-en-el-noreste-de-brasil-dejan-al-menos-seis-muertos/2026-05-02/221032.html'>Cooperativa</a>)</li><li>Pernambuco fire department: The fire department said it used 26 rescue boats to evacuate 525 people who had been isolated by flooding. (<a href='https://www.cooperativa.cl/noticias/mundo/brasil/fuertes-temporales-en-el-noreste-de-brasil-dejan-al-menos-seis-muertos/2026-05-02/221032.html'>Cooperativa</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/at-least-six-dead-thousands-displaced-as-heavy-rains-hit-northeastern-brazil'>At least six dead, thousands displaced as heavy rains hit northeastern Brazil</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/5/2/at-least-six-dead-in-heavy-rains-in-northeast-brazil-thousands-displaced'>At least six dead in heavy rains in northeast Brazil, thousands displaced</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://tribune.com.pk/story/2606098/six-dead-as-heavy-rains-hit-brazil'>Six dead as heavy rains hit Brazil</a> - tribune.com.pk</li><li><a href='https://energynews.oedigital.com/environment/2026/05/02/as-heavy-rains-strike-northeastern-brazil-at-least-six-people-are-dead-and-thousands-of-others-have-been-displaced'>As heavy rains strike northeastern Brazil, at least six people are dead and thousands of others have been displaced.</a> - oedigital.com</li><li><a href='https://www1.pluska.sk/spravy/zaplavy-smrti-v-brazilii-silne-dazde-vzali-zivoty-a-tisice-ludi-utekaju-zo-svojich-domovov'>Záplavy smrti v Brazílii: Silné dažde vzali životy a tisíce ľudí utekajú zo svojich domovov</a> - pluska.sk</li><li><a href='https://www.cooperativa.cl/noticias/mundo/brasil/fuertes-temporales-e